<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Gemini Created Site</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS for Styling */
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f9;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav ul {
            list-style-type: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: #34495e;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            display: block;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            transition: background-color 0.3s;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            background-color: #4e6d8c;
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1 { color: #2c3e50; }
        
        button {
            background-color: #27ae60;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        button:hover { background-color: #2ecc71; }

        footer {
            background-color: #2c3e50;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin-top: auto;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Services</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
    </nav>

    <main>
        <h2>Created by Gemini</h2>
        <p>This is a fundamental example of a website structure. Everything you see here—the layout, the colors, the navigation, and this text—was generated by an AI model.</p>
        <p>HTML (HyperText Markup Language) provides the skeleton, CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) provides the look, and JavaScript adds the action.</p>
        
        <button id="actionButton">Click Me for Magic</button>
        <p id="magicMessage" style="display:none; margin-top: 15px; color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold;"></p>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2024 AI Generated Webpage</p>
    </footer>

    <script>
        // JavaScript for Interactivity
        document.getElementById('actionButton').addEventListener('click', function() {
            const message = document.getElementById('magicMessage');
            message.textContent = "Hello! I am JavaScript, and I make this page interactive. I can change content instantly without reloading!";
            message.style.display = 'block';
            this.textContent = "The Magic Happened!";
            this.style.backgroundColor = "#95a5a6";
            this.disabled = true;
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
